<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Friday's close, Fresh loins were steady to $3.00 lower; butts steady to $1.00 lower; skinned hams $1.00-2.00 lower; seedless bellies $1.00-2.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to $2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings.</p>
